{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794558801186,"sessionID":"ses_e2bf67522ffeXDCV6Z2AUOqOyV","part":{"partID":"prt_1d40a302b001C9UKM4kWPheJOP","sessionID":"ses_e2bf67522ffeXDCV6Z2AUOqOyV","messageID":"msg_1d40a1f31001RBKygkMfG1IZvt","type":"tool","id":"call_eb83926a21784ee7abf791f9","tool":"shell","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"command":"cd .skilled/hooks/shared && node --test tests/session-readers/dsh.test.mjs 2>&1 | tail -20","workdir":"/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research"},"output":"✔ the project key matches the folder name DSH writes (0.375167ms)\n✔ a session log resolves by header id and matching cwd (2.180708ms)\n✔ an injected notice is returned apart from the records (1.500542ms)\n✔ a session path outside the store is refused without reading it (1.687792ms)\n✔ a project-key collision is rejected by the header cwd (1.799583ms)\n✔ an absent id is a session_not_found even when a newer session exists (1.3255ms)\n✔ a missing store is a store_unreadable (0.471083ms)\n✔ a compressed log is decoded through its frame chain (2.152917ms)\n✔ a torn plain log still yields its complete entries (2.445292ms)\n✔ a pruned tool result keeps its full first copy and the event time (5.322084ms)\nℹ tests 10\nℹ suites 0\nℹ pass 10\nℹ fail 0\nℹ cancelled 0\nℹ skipped 0\nℹ todo 0\nℹ duration_ms 92.389625\n","title":"shell","metadata":{"metadata":{"status":"completed","truncated":false,"exit":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"✔ the project key matches the folder name DSH writes (0.375167ms)\n✔ a session log resolves by header id and matching cwd (2.180708ms)\n✔ an injected notice is returned apart from the records (1.500542ms)\n✔ a session path outside the store is refused without reading it (1.687792ms)\n✔ a project-key collision is rejected by the header cwd (1.799583ms)\n✔ an absent id is a session_not_found even when a newer session exists (1.3255ms)\n✔ a missing store is a store_unreadable (0.471083ms)\n✔ a compressed log is decoded through its frame chain (2.152917ms)\n✔ a torn plain log still yields its complete entries (2.445292ms)\n✔ a pruned tool result keeps its full first copy and the event time (5.322084ms)\nℹ tests 10\nℹ suites 0\nℹ pass 10\nℹ fail 0\nℹ cancelled 0\nℹ skipped 0\nℹ todo 0\nℹ duration_ms 92.389625\n"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"command\":\"cd .skilled/hooks/shared && node --test tests/session-readers/dsh.test.mjs 2>&1 | tail -20\",\"workdir\":\"/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research\"}"},"time":{"start":1794558799915,"end":1794558801186}}}}
