{"type":"text","timestamp":1794558877514,"sessionID":"ses_e2bf67522ffeXDCV6Z2AUOqOyV","part":{"id":"prt_1d40b48fc002FHDzedpf92j5mr","sessionID":"ses_e2bf67522ffeXDCV6Z2AUOqOyV","messageID":"msg_1d40b366c001DoRJ6ofqT7pvpq","type":"text","text":"T043 done. One test added to `.skilled/hooks/shared/tests/session-readers/dsh.test.mjs`, no source change, checkbox left unticked.\n\n**File written**\n- `.skilled/hooks/shared/tests/session-readers/dsh.test.mjs` — new case `an event with no source is injected as unknown`. It appends a `user/message` event with `seq: 5`, `data.role: 'user'`, no `data.source`, and content `[{ type: 'text', text: 'notice' }]` to the `dshSession` fixture, then asserts `injected` deep-equals `[{ source: 'unknown', text: 'notice' }]` and that no record carries a text block reading `notice`.\n\n**Verify**, from the repository root (`NT $SRT/dsh.test.mjs`, i.e. `node --test .skilled/hooks/shared/tests/session-readers/dsh.test.mjs`):\n\n```\n✔ the project key matches the folder name DSH writes (0.427708ms)\n✔ a session log resolves by header id and matching cwd (2.482416ms)\n✔ an injected notice is returned apart from the records (2.027333ms)\n✔ an event with no source is injected as unknown (2.03225ms)\n✔ a session path outside the store is refused without reading it (2.318568ms)\n✔ a project-key collision is rejected by the header cwd (2.231333ms)\n✔ an absent id is a session_not_found even when a newer session exists (1.48275ms)\n✔ a missing store is a store_unreadable (0.498208ms)\n✔ a compressed log is decoded through its frame chain (2.251083ms)\n✔ a torn plain log still yields its complete entries (1.959292ms)\n✔ a pruned tool result keeps its full first copy and the event time (2.675583ms)\nℹ tests 11\nℹ suites 0\nℹ pass 11\nℹ fail 0\nℹ cancelled 0\nℹ skipped 0\nℹ todo 0\nℹ duration_ms 69.294042\n```\n\nThat is `fail 0` with 11 tests, one more than the 10 the file held before the edit.\n\n**Reads supporting the pin** (observed, not changed): `recordsFromEvents` in `.skilled/hooks/shared/session-readers/dsh.mjs:195` admits a user message only when `data.source?.kind === 'user'`, and `injectedFromEvents` at `:253` maps a missing source to `'unknown'`. Both assertions in the new case bite on those two facts.\n\n**Not done / caveats**\n- No negative control was run by mutating the reader, because the task names only the test file. The case is a pin, as the task states, and it passes against the current reader.\n- `git status` shows `devin.mjs` and `devin.test.mjs` modified in the same folder. Those are another lane's work (T042), untouched by me. My diff is only `dsh.test.mjs`, confirmed with `git -c core.fsmonitor=false diff`.\n- Nothing is blocked on the operator. The orchestrator still owns ticking T043 and the phase gates.","time":{"start":1794558871804,"end":1794558877514}}}
